格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness Bundle for Unreal Engine 5.8 via Unreal MCP","id":"gh:1346144352","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-unreal-mcp","slug":"PeterTXPan/dsh-unreal-mcp","topics":["ai-agents","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-bundle","dsh-plugin","dsh-skill","game-development","mcp","model-context-protocol","ue5","unreal-engine","unreal-engine-5","unreal-mcp"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Bundle for Unreal Engine 5.8 via Unreal MCP"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-unreal-mcp"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Unofficial DeepSeek Harness Bundle for Unreal Engine 5.8's official Unreal MCP\nserver."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The Bundle is a thin UE adapter. It reuses Unreal's\n`ModelContextProtocol`, `ToolsetRegistry`, and `"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"AllToolsets`, and mounts the MCP\nClient already supplied by DeepSeek Harness. It does not include Un"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"real Engine\ncode, add a UE `.uplugin`, fork DSH, or implement a general-purpose MCP client."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Scope"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"This project aims to bring DSH's **UE adapter capabilities** toward the same\npractical boundary as E"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"pic's Claude Code integration:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"It owns Bundle packaging, Unreal endpoint configuration, `.uproject` and UE\nsource context, Unreal S"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"kills, read-only diagnostics, UE workflow coverage, and\nadapter-level compatibility evidence."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"It does not own DSH's general context management, Agent Loop, model behavior,\nsessions, approvals, t"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ool scheduling, retries, or the generic MCP protocol\nimplementation. A problem reproducible with a n"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"on-Unreal MCP server should be\nreduced and reported upstream instead of fixed here as UE-specific be"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"al MCP server should be\nreduced and reported upstream instead of fixed here as UE-specific behavior."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Capabilities"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The Bundle provides:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- a Cordis plugin managed by DSH's load/unload lifecycle;\n- three bundled Unreal Skills registered t"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"hrough `ctx.skills`;\n- per-session `.uproject` and UE source-tree detection;\n- concise Unreal contex"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"t routed through `ctx.systemPrompt.context()`;\n- one loopback-only endpoint setting shared by the co"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ntext and MCP Client row;\n- a read-only diagnostic for connection, Tool Search, and ToolsetRegistry;"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"\n- DSH-specific adaptations of Epic's MIT-licensed Unreal Skill guidance."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The bundled Skills are:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- `unreal-mcp` for discovering and invoking existing Unreal Editor Toolsets;\n- `create-toolset` for "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"authoring AI-callable C++ or Python Toolsets;\n- `unreal-skill` for authoring UE Agent Skills registe"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"red inside the Editor."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The last item is distinct from a DSH harness Skill: it guides creation of\n`UAgentSkill` classes or p"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"roject-specific Skill assets managed by Unreal."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Repository tests cover the package, Skill, context, endpoint validation, and\nplugin lifecycle. Unrea"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"l MCP has editor-level privileges, so mutating tasks must\nuse a disposable project with a tested rec"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"overy point and retain matching tool\nresults and final Editor state as evidence."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Prerequisites"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Unreal Engine 5.8 with `ModelContextProtocol` and `AllToolsets` enabled\n- DeepSeek Harness with Bu"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ndle and plugin APIs compatible with 0.1.1-rc.2\n- Node.js 20 or newer and pnpm available to `dsh plu"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"gin`\n- a disposable Unreal test project"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The recorded compatibility configuration is UE 5.8.1, DSH 0.1.1-rc.2,\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"0.1.1-rc.2, Node.js 20/22/24, and macOS arm64."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Build and verify"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`npm run check` compiles `dist/`, runs the Bundle tests, checks the package\nallowlist and executable"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" bit, installs the generated tarball into a clean npm\nproject, and exercises the installed Skill/con"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"the generated tarball into a clean npm\nproject, and exercises the installed Skill/context lifecycle."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Install into a DSH Profile"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"From a built checkout:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"For a reviewed tarball:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"From npm:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"One DSH command installs the Bundle layer. Its Cordis patch loads this package\nand configures DSH's "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"in-box `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` for the Unreal MCP\nendpoint; users do not copy a Skill or edit "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"epseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` for the Unreal MCP\nendpoint; users do not copy a Skill or edit DSH source."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"An npm tarball contains prebuilt `dist/` and installs without running project\ncode. A direct GitHub "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"install builds through `prepare`; pnpm 10+ may require the\nuser to allow that package build explicit"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ly, so releases should prefer npm or a\nreviewed tarball."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Connect Unreal"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Enable `ModelContextProtocol` and `AllToolsets`, then run this in the Unreal\nEditor console:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"A successful Output Log contains:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Start DSH from the Unreal project directory:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The configured endpoint is `http://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp`. An optional\n`DSH_UNREAL_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS` chan"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ges the MCP call timeout. Source engine\ncheckouts can provide `DSH_UNREAL_ENGINE_ROOT`; game project"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"s are found by\nwalking upward from each session's working directory."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"See setup.md for persistent startup and\noperations.md for troubleshooting."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Diagnose the live connection"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"The diagnostic is read-only. It performs MCP initialization, verifies\n`list_toolsets`/`describe_tool"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"set`/`call_tool`, and confirms Unreal returns a\nnon-empty toolset catalog. It reports separate error"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"s for a missing project,\nan unreachable endpoint, missing Tool Search meta-tools, and an empty catal"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"or a missing project,\nan unreachable endpoint, missing Tool Search meta-tools, and an empty catalog."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"The Bundle plugin, its context and Skill provider, and its configured MCP row\nare removed from that "},{"id":"p46s2","text":", its context and Skill provider, and its configured MCP row\nare removed from that Profile together."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Safety and evidence"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"Unreal MCP has editor-level privileges and some toolsets can execute Python.\nThe bundled Skill tells"},{"id":"p48s2","text":" the agent to issue UE calls sequentially, require\nexplicit user authorization before mutations, and"},{"id":"p48s3","text":" inspect UE state before\nretrying a non-idempotent operation. Enforcement remains the responsibility"},{"id":"p48s4","text":" of\nDSH and the execution environment; this Bundle does not add a generic approval,\nscheduler, sandb"},{"id":"p48s5","text":"ox, or retry subsystem."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"A final answer is not proof by itself: release claims require matching Unreal\ntool results and final"},{"id":"p49s2","text":" is not proof by itself: release claims require matching Unreal\ntool results and final Editor state."},{"id":"p50s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"Report vulnerabilities according to SECURITY.md."},{"id":"p52s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"Project-original code and documentation are MIT licensed. Adapted Epic Skill\nmaterial retains Epic's"},{"id":"p53s2","text":" MIT notice in\nEPIC-UNREAL-SKILLS-MIT.txt. Unreal Engine\nand its plugins remain governed by Epic's a"},{"id":"p53s3","text":"pplicable terms. See\nTHIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

